{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28125","headline":"和河南白尹西池北新葺水斋招赏十二韵 · 雍陶","name":"和河南白尹西池北新葺水斋招赏十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二室峯前水，三川府右亭。\n乱流深竹迳，分遶小花汀。\n池角通泉脉，堂心豁地形。\n坐中寒瑟瑟，牀下细泠泠。\n雨夜思巫峡，秋朝想洞庭。\n千年孤镜碧，一片远天青。\n鱼戏摇红尾，鸥闲退白翎。\n荷倾泻珠露，沙乱动金星。\n藤架如纱帐，苔墙似锦屏。\n龙门人少到，仙棹自多停。\n游忆高僧伴，吟招野客听。\n余波不能惜，便欲养浮萍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}